# Xcode / Swift .gitignore
# Based on github/gitignore Swift + Xcode templates

## User settings & state
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout

## Build artifacts
build/
DerivedData/
*.moved-aside
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

# NOTE: The project is Xcode-managed and committed (see README). We still ignore
# per-user state below; only the shared project structure is tracked.

## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/

## CocoaPods / Carthage (unused, but ignore if added later)
Pods/
Carthage/Build/

## Editor / tooling local state
.claude/
.agents/

## Face-model conversion tooling — local, one-time (scripts/convert_adaface.py,
## scripts/convert_sface.py). Neither the large source models (AdaFace .ckpt
## ~700 MB, SFace .onnx), the Python venv, nor the converted 83 MB .mlpackage
## are tracked (non-commercial weights + repo bloat). Regenerate the model
## locally with convert_adaface.py; the app gates on its presence in Resources/.
.venv/
*.onnx
*.ckpt
__pycache__/
PhotoSwipe/Resources/FaceEmbedding.mlpackage/

## macOS
.DS_Store

## Misc
*.swp
*.save

## Markdown — keep product/legal docs, the final v5/v6 briefs, and engineering
## notes tracked. Older version briefs and personal scratchpads stay local.
*.md
!README.md
!THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md
!PhotoSwipe_v5_Instructions.md
!PhotoSwipe_v6_Instructions.md
!docs/
!docs/*.md

## Claude skills lock (local tooling state, like .agents/)
skills-lock.json
